 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.16,
   "text": "This is Gary. Those are his brand-new shoes. And that is buttered toast. Let's back up ten minutes. Gary has a theory."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.5,
   "end": 9.02,
   "text": "Toast lands butter-side down because butter is heavy!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 9.32,
   "end": 11.28,
   "text": "Joe doesn't look up from his phone. Uh-huh.\" Test one."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.46,
   "end": 13.86,
   "text": "Splat. Butter down. Fine. I'll butter the bottom too."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.06,
   "end": 15.32,
   "text": "Trick gravity.\" Test two."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.58,
   "end": 16.16,
   "text": "The toast tips,"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.38,
   "end": 18.9,
   "text": "flips half a turn… Splat. Right on the new shoes."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.08,
   "end": 24.36,
   "text": "Gravity hates me!\" Joe shrugs. Gravity doesn't care. Look at the table.\" Gary doesn't look at the table."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.58,
   "end": 26.52,
   "text": "Gary builds a bigger one. Table."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.82,
   "end": 27.16,
   "text": "Crate. Chair."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.46,
   "end": 28.44,
   "text": "Ten feet of pure science."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.68,
   "end": 30.1,
   "text": "Gary climbs to the top,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.34,
   "end": 32.12,
   "text": "holds his breath, and nudges the toast."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.4,
   "end": 33.82,
   "text": "Test three. Down it goes."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.08,
   "end": 35.6,
   "text": "Half a turn… a whole turn…"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.14,
   "end": 36.6,
   "text": "BUTTER UP!"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.94,
   "end": 37.94,
   "text": "I beat physics!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 39.0,
   "end": 41.02,
   "text": "Physics was just waiting for the tower."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.78,
   "end": 43.32,
   "text": "It's not the butter. It's the table.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 43.5,
   "end": 49.44,
   "text": "Let's replay that. The toast starts spinning the second it tips off the edge. From a normal table, about thirty inches,"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.74,
   "end": 51.22,
   "text": "it only has time for half a turn."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.62,
   "end": 55.44,
   "text": "Half a turn means butter down. Every time. To spin all the way around,"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.62,
   "end": 60.54,
   "text": "your table needs to be about ten feet tall. A physicist proved this in 1995 and won an Ig Nobel Prize."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.08,
   "end": 64.35,
   "text": "Gary won a toast hat. Well. At least it missed the shoes.\" Splat."
  }
 ],
